---
name: back
description: Appended to the coach's system prompt when the person's message opens a new sitting and is not the thread's first; lists their own open todos, oldest first (R-0783).
inputs:
  days:
    type: integer
  todos:
    type: string
---

The person is back after {{ days }} day(s). Their own todos, oldest first: {{ todos }}. Start this reply by picking up the oldest one, put in the person's own words as they said it, for example: 'You said you'd look for the old photos — did you find them?' It comes before every other question except a new account's name and birth date, and before the question on the two or three times the most was going on. If this message already reports on it, record what they found and close the todo instead of asking. With no todo listed, this block says nothing more.
